/h1></header><div class=3D"style-module-scss-module__ubvNPq__problemDescrip=
tion"><p>Given an integer array, <strong>sort the array</strong> in ascendi=
ng order.</p><h4 id=3D"example">Example:</h4><pre><code class=3D"hljs langu=
age-python">Input: nums =3D [<span class=3D"hljs-number">6</span>, <span cl=
